	<div class="fl-module-content fl-node-content">
		<div class="fl-rich-text">
	<p>The business had seen a significant drop in sales volume and quality of service. The online reputation was very poor, the website was essentially a text based landing page, and they had zero visibility in the organics on page one of Google for their area. It was clear from our research that with the right approach there was an opportunity to pick up business for a relatively wide catchment area. The biggest challenge was the sheer volume of competition for their products and services on the Sunshine Coast region.</p>
