<div class="fl-module fl-module-rich-text fl-node-61a45d85d4605" data-node="61a45d85d4605">
	<div class="fl-module-content fl-node-content">
		<div class="fl-rich-text">
	<p>We initially focused on Google adwords search campaigns across the more popular services based on traffic volume. These campaigns performed well but the sheer volume of suppliers was driving the advertising costs up and although quoting the client was winning fewer jobs. Analysing the data we had so far we were able to build a clearer understanding of the competitive landscape and we decided to pivot the campaign focus to a more niche product. Combining this with custom landing pages and fresh ad copy, lead and sale volume increased immediately and the client had their best day sales on record.</p>
