	<div class="fl-module-content fl-node-content">
		<div class="fl-rich-text">
	<p>The Customer's website was not performing well. It was essentially a one page site which was text heavy, had few call to actions, did not present all their products, had no gallery, little by way of SEO optimisation and spoke little about the owners who are key to the KR Blinds Brand. We produced a brand new website and launched it within 8 weeks, with every aspect from build, design, to written content executed in house. We created clear CTAs, contact forms, offer pages, and set up full event tracking to monitor performance.</p>
